Google's official "G" mark for Sign in with Google buttons.

Source:  https://developers.google.com/identity/images/g-logo.png
Fetched: 2026-10-19
Bytes:   33661 (200 x 204 RGBA PNG), UNMODIFIED.

Google's branding guidelines for Sign in with Google require the official asset, used unmodified,
on a sign-in button. That is the only place this SDK draws it: the `social_login` block's `google`
provider. It is not resized by hand, not recoloured, and not used as a general-purpose icon.

  https://developers.google.com/identity/branding-guidelines

🔴 Do not edit this file. Re-fetch it from the URL above if it ever needs updating, so what ships
stays byte-identical to what Google publishes.
